      "quote": "The quality of the studies included in the systematic review was evaluated using the 'quality assessment tools for quantitative studies', recommended by the National Collaborating Centre for Methods and Tools [12]. This tool is accompanied by a detailed dictionary that provides explicit guidance for decision-making within each domain (S1 File).",
